The minus-type extraspecial subgroup E has order 512, and the quotient of its normaliser in GL(16,3) by E has order 394813440.
GO-(8,2) has 16771 subgroup classes, of which 16471 are solvable.
The quadratic-form test on invariant subspaces of E/Z(E) retains 230 classes; all 230 are irreducible and quasiprimitive.
The 21523360 projective points form 87125 E/Z(E)-orbits; 81600 have trivial point stabiliser.
The induced action on the E/Z(E)-orbits with trivial point stabiliser is faithful, with image order 394813440.
All 230 minus-type lifts have a regular orbit.
